{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "uze",
  "description": "UZE's own look: monochrome. A near-black backdrop, warm off-white text, and an accent that is the ink at full strength; hue is spent only where it means something (success, warning, danger, diffs, states). Structure comes from hairline dividers, never from filled slabs.",
